# The applications in Palmframe's default install: works_minimal = yes in
# apps.tsv and worth having on a fresh system. One binary name per line; each
# is distro/out/bin/<name> -> /usr/bin/<name>, with
# distro/apps/desktop/<name>.desktop -> /usr/share/applications/ where one
# exists (wm and greeter are the session, not launchable applications).
wm
greeter
term
launcher
files
editor
notes
calc
sysmon
image
docs
sheets
slides
calendar
reader
photoshop
maps
money
torrent
store
network
